unty"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids January to February came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years. In 2025 the middle saw July to August at 143% of normal and September to October at 52%. So far in 2026 it has run short, with January to February at 17% and June to July at 80% on the middle. Grid 28332 had its driest year in 1976 at 53%.</p>"}
